Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-soup-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0
Description: Native read-only lyrics display for SPlayer-Next
